<title>TURKEY: Turkish treasury sells 40 trln lira of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Turkish treasury sells 40 trln lira of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish Treasury said it had sold a nominal 40 trillion lira of a 110 trillion lira offer of 362-day T-bills on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The treasury had offered the T-bills, at 97 percent yield excluding withholding tax, to meet its 61 trillion lira T-bill redemption.</p>
</text>
